  "description": "Crew Dart20-S\nThe Crew Dart20-S takes the compact, bike-life-ready Dart20 platform and levels it up with more capability, comfort, and range. An 80mm travel suspension fork smooths out rough streets and adds control when the riding gets technical, while the integrated front plate gives the bike an aggressive, moto-inspired look.\nA punchy 750W rear hub motor is paired with an upgraded 48V / 14Ah battery for longer rides and extended sessions. Hydraulic disc brakes provide confident stopping power, while fat Crew Blockster Tires, 20x 4.0\" Front and 20 x 4.5\" Rear, deliver plenty of grip and cushion. Finished with a powerful 48V headlight, the Dart20-S is built for cruising, wheelies, ride-outs, and everything in between.\nRecommended for riders 4'10\"–5'10\".",
